[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584286\">1084A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584371\">1084A22</a></p><p>1. Raise the vehicle, undo the nuts (1a) and move the cable protection\n(1a).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021191.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel injectors\non the single fuel manifold pipe.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D81</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021192.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and the bolts (1b), then remove the inlet\nmanifold (1c), complete with gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021193.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the inlet manifold  complete with\na new gasket, back in its housing and fix it tightening the bolt\nand nuts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INLET MANIFOLD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>INLET MANIFOLD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ninjectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D81</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the cable protection back in its\nhousing and secure it using the nuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584371\">1084A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584286\">1084A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584286\">1084A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]